cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the schemes, please cite the software and the corresponding papers listed in the references."
type: software
title: "Efficient High Order Trotterizations"
abstract: >-
  Derivation, implementation and application of Trotter-Suzuki decomposition schemes at high orders.
  Contains the recursive formulae (Mathematica and the Python package pybch), a C++ minimizer for efficient
  schemes up to order 8, archived and recommended schemes at orders 2, 4, 6 and 8, time evolution of the
  Heisenberg model and the quantum harmonic oscillator, and noisy quantum circuit simulations with qiskit-omelyan.
authors:
